    "Since a student can work a partial slot (e.g., 1 hour of a 2-hour slot), how is the \"exactly one student on duty\" requirement enforced within a slot — must the two hours of each slot be covered by the same single student (so a student either takes a full 2-hour slot or not at all), or can two different students split the two hours of a slot (e.g., one works the first hour, another the second)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the enforcement of the 'exactly one student on duty' rule within a slot, specifically whether the slot must be covered by one student or can be split between two."
}

